            "sid": "NUM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambirira Musa omu ihamba rya Sinai, ari omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwezi kwa kabiri omu mwaka gwa kabiri barugire omu nsi ya Misri, ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 30:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.2+NUM.26.3+NUM.26.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 26:2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mubare eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli, nk'oku enganda zaabo ziri n'emiryango ya baishenkurubo oku eri, mubare abashaija boona, omwe omwe, nk'amaziina gaabo oku gari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, ab'omuri Israeli abarikubaasa kuhurura; iwe na Arooni mubabare nk'emitwe y'engabo zaabo oku eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwatanise n'omuntu omwe omuri buri ruganda, omukuru w'omuryango gwa baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga nigo maziina g'abashaija abaraakwatanise naimwe. Omu ruganda rwa Reubeeni, Elizuuri mwene Shedeuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Simeoni, Shelumieli mwene Zuri-Shadai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Yuda, Nahashooni mwene Aminadabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Isakaari, Netaneeli mwene Zuari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Zebuluuni, Eliabu mwene Heloni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuri beene Yosefu, ow'omu rwa Efuraimu, Elishaama mwene Amihuudi; omu rwa Manaase, Gamalieli mwene Pedazuuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Benyamiini, Abidaani mwene Gideoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Daani, Ahiezeeri mwene Ami-shadai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Asheri, Pagieli mwene Okiraani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Gaadi, Eliasaafu mwene Deueli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu rwa Nafutaali, Ahiira mwene Enani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo baatoorainwe omu ihanga ryona, abaabaire bari abeebembezi b'enganda za baishenkurubo, kandi abakuru b'emiryango y'Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa na Arooni baatwara abantu abo abu amaziina gaabo gaagambwaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baateerana eihanga ryona aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwezi kwa kabiri, baayehandiikisa nk'enganda zaabo oku zaabaire ziri n'emiryango ya baishenkurubo oku yaabaire eri, baabara amaziina gaabo omwe omwe, abahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa, nikwo yaababariire omu ihamba rya Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baahandiika oruzaaro rwa Reubeeni, omujigaijo gwa Israeli, nk'emiryango yaabo oku eri, n'amaju ga baishenkurubo oku gaabaire gari, nibabara amaziina g'abashaija boona omwe omwe, abahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, boona abarikubaasa kuhurura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omu ruganda rwa Reubeeni abaabazirwe baaba obukumi buna n'enkumi mukaaga na magana ataano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
