        {
          "text": "Baahandiika oruzaaro rwa Gaadi, nk'emiryango yaabo oku yaabaire eri, n'amaju ga baishenkurubo oku gaabaire gari, nibabara amaziina g'abashaija boona omwe omwe abahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho, boona abarikubaasa kuhurura. ",
