          "text": " Kandi Obutaaho ku buriba nibwimuka kugyenda, Abaleevi babe nibo baabukuura; kandi ku buriba nibuza kuteerwa, Abaleevi babe nibo baabuteera. Otari Muleevi weena ku aribuhika haihi, aitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
